### 东信和平拣货完成接口测试
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### 0. 前置：先上传主单（成功）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COMPLETE-0001",
  "userId": "USER-COMPLETE-01",
  "userName": "测试员",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "U001",
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U002",
      "materialCode": "MAT002",
      "batchNo": "B20260326",
      "locationCode": "A-01-03",
      "planQuantity": 50,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 1. 拣货完成-成功（批量）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COMPLETE-0001",
  "userId": "USER-COMPLETE-01",
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "U001",
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 100,
      "updateTime": 1648195200000
    },
    {
      "id": "U002",
      "materialCode": "MAT002",
      "batchNo": "B20260326",
      "locationCode": "A-01-03",
      "planQuantity": 50,
      "actualQuantity": 50,
      "updateTime": 1648195260000
    }
  ]
}

### 1.1 同库位全部拣完后触发灭灯（locationCode=A-02-01）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COMPLETE-0002",
  "userId": "USER-COMPLETE-02",
  "userName": "测试员2",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "U101",
      "materialCode": "MAT101",
      "batchNo": "B20260327",
      "locationCode": "A-02-01",
      "planQuantity": 10,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U102",
      "materialCode": "MAT102",
      "batchNo": "B20260327",
      "locationCode": "A-02-01",
      "planQuantity": 20,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

