### 2. 参数错误-details为空（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COMPLETE-0001",
  "userId": "USER-COMPLETE-01",
  "details": []
}

### 3. 参数错误-负数数量（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-COMPLETE-0001",
  "userId": "USER-COMPLETE-01",
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "U001",
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": -1,
      "updateTime": 1648195200000
    }
  ]
}

### 4. 业务错误-主单不存在（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-NOT-EXIST",
  "userId": "USER-NOT-EXIST",
  "details": [
    {
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 100,
      "updateTime": 1648195200000
    }
  ]
}

### 5. 多人同波次同库位场景-准备甲用户数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-MULTI-0001",
  "userId": "USER-A",
  "userName": "甲",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "MA-001",
      "materialCode": "MAT-A1",
      "batchNo": "B-MULTI-01",
      "locationCode": "A-03-01",
      "planQuantity": 10,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 6. 多人同波次同库位场景-准备乙用户数据（与甲重叠库位）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-MULTI-0001",
  "userId": "USER-B",
  "userName": "乙",
  "updateTime": 1648195201000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "MB-001",
      "materialCode": "MAT-B1",
      "batchNo": "B-MULTI-01",
      "locationCode": "A-03-01",
      "planQuantity": 20,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 7. 甲先完成（乙未完成）-不应灭灯，应同步亮灯 BLUE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-MULTI-0001",
  "userId": "USER-A",
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "MA-001",
      "materialCode": "MAT-A1",
      "batchNo": "B-MULTI-01",
      "locationCode": "A-03-01",
      "planQuantity": 10,
      "actualQuantity": 10,
      "updateTime": 1648195202000
    }
  ]
}

### 8. 乙再完成（同库位全部完成）-应同步灭灯
