### 9. 巷道灯聚合-准备同LED两库位数据（需预先在t_location_led将A-04-01/A-04-02绑定到同一led_id）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-AISLE-0001",
  "userId": "USER-AISLE-01",
  "userName": "巷道测试员",
  "updateTime": 1648195300000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "AL-001",
      "materialCode": "MAT-AL-01",
      "batchNo": "B-AISLE-01",
      "locationCode": "A-04-01",
      "planQuantity": 10,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "AL-002",
      "materialCode": "MAT-AL-02",
      "batchNo": "B-AISLE-01",
      "locationCode": "A-04-02",
      "planQuantity": 20,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

